{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45686","headline":"偶作五首 一 · 贯休","name":"偶作五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁信心火多，多能焚大国。\n谁信鬓上丝，茎茎出蚕腹。\n尝闻养蚕妇，未晓上桑树。\n下树畏蚕饥，儿啼亦不顾。\n一春膏血尽，岂止应王赋。\n如何酷吏酷，尽爲搜将去。\n蚕蛾爲蝶飞，僞叶空满枝。\n冤梭与恨机，一见一沾衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}